    Left Shifts   1  1  2  2  2  2  2  2  1  2  2  2  2  2  2  1

 1.2.3.2  Permute the concatenation C[i]D[i] as indicated below. This 
will yield K[i], which is 48 bits long.

                        Permuted Choice 2 (PC-2)

